cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AV Sensor-Integrity Monitor (simulation)"
abstract: >-
  An open, simulation-only sensor-fusion and fault-integrity study for an
  automated vehicle: how a system knows when it can't trust its own sensors and
  fails safe instead of failing. Milestone M0 delivers the sensor-fusion
  foundation (an Extended Kalman Filter fusing GPS, IMU, and wheel speed) with
  the estimate tracking ground truth under nominal conditions.
type: software
authors:
